{"v":4,"catch":"享受放鬆的拼圖遊戲，單手遊玩也不是問題。","desc":"《Hentai Uni》是一款拼圖益智遊戲，有 4 名女孩和 12 張精美的手繪美術圖在遊戲中等著你。\n\n選擇各張圖片的拼圖碎片，調換順序來找出正確的組合，以復原出完整的圖片。圖片上的可愛女孩們絕對值得你的時間！現有超過 40 個關卡等你去破解。可以在鑑賞模式中回顧所有的圖片。\n\n一款可以放鬆遊玩的遊戲，隨時隨地都能享受。","publisher":"eastasiasoft","release":"2022-09-08","genres":["益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/75d48b2af30c78817b8ffe221a4dccbff3fd5c3cc3d4bb6975eeb6d64bd376a6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee94d99ebebe6317a078c7bd23ece2299dafe13122867b152aee070fabd631e1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5de50806a4a4af2890bf04a1ea498d0f04085cb0b01a9fbf737fbc1a94d50e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f95cc5b84ceae02044f6f0cb810dfcb0657b398cb4f8a24a22ec49da1c80b684.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d3b20fc18f40364aef8ea9a2bbba7d8a7df9388464806ecc6f58e04f48fdc0bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1a71f06a92f22729233da7a0a917cb7cb00b3e38e3a534e28d5e655f1004d0b.jpg"],"titleId":"010081c019182000","dlc":[]}